# The server secrets volume (OPAQUE seed, server keys). Mirrors compose.yaml's `secrets`
# volume (named `rizzy-vault-secrets`; ADR 0010 §4, INV-50). Mounted read-only into the server
# container (rizzy-vault.container); only the admin one-off commands in docs/self-hosting.md
# §13 "Admin one-offs" mount it writable. Back it up with `backup-secrets`
# ([§5](self-hosting.md#5-the-secrets-file)) — never together with rizzy-vault-data.volume.
#
# Unverified: the minimum Podman version VolumeName= needs (docs/self-hosting.md §13).

[Volume]
VolumeName=rizzy-vault-secrets
